      "id": "dawnreach_room_0009",
      "title": "Suncrest Lane",
      "roomType": "",
      "description": "Golden-stone buildings stand shoulder to shoulder along this busy lane, their painted signs advertising the services of local craftsmen.\nThe ringing of hammers and murmur of trade spill from open doorways as townsfolk move between workshops and market stalls.\nSunlight catches the upper windows throughout much of the day, lending the street its familiar name.",
