    {
      "id": "dawnreach_room_0012",
      "title": "The Radiant Anvil",
      "roomType": "",
      "description": "Armor of polished steel, hardened leather, and linked mail hangs neatly from racks covering the walls of this warm, smoky workshop.\nA massive forge burns behind a scarred stone counter, its orange glow dancing across shields and breastplates awaiting their owners.\nThe steady hammering of the resident armorer promises protection for anyone with enough coin to purchase it.",
