    },
    {
      "id": "dawnreach_room_0014",
      "title": "Silverleaf Path",
      "roomType": "",
      "description": "Ancient trees shade this narrow stone path, their pale-green leaves whispering softly whenever the wind passes through their branches.\nSmall homes and carefully tended gardens become less frequent as the path winds away from the crowded center of Dawnreach.\nBeyond the last buildings, the peaceful trail leads toward the wilder lands surrounding the settlement.",
