      "lockString": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dawnreach_room_0019",
      "title": "Sanctuary of the Gentle Hand",
      "roomType": "",
      "description": "Soft candlelight and the fragrance of healing herbs fill this quiet chamber, offering immediate relief from the noise of the streets outside.\nClean beds line the walls beneath shelves crowded with bandages, medicines, dried plants, and carefully labeled glass bottles.\nValroian healers tend the wounded here, providing sanctuary to those who return from the wilds battered but still breathing.",
